# Force LF regardless of the checkout machine's OS/git config — this repo
# is developed on Windows but `apps/api`'s Dockerfile and `scripts/*.sh`
# both run on Linux (the Contabo VPS, plan.md §36). A shell script checked
# out with CRLF line endings has a broken shebang (`#!/usr/bin/env bash\r`
# is not a valid interpreter path) and fails outright on Linux — this is
# the fix, not a style preference.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
